{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"My dearest Marie,\n\nI return to my lodgings in Vienna with a mind full of impressions. I spent the morning until noon at Prince Lichtenstein’s gallery, marveling at the collection, before journeying to Währing to visit Rembold, the local professor of philosophy. It is always good to find a kindred spirit in these provinces.\n\nAfter crossing an arm of the Danube, I took lunch in the Augarten and walked through the Prater. The air is pleasant, though the heat remains. I concluded the day at the Leopoldstadt theatre. Schuster’s performance as the Magister was amusing, and we finished with *Die Zauberbirn*. I confess I enjoyed the evening immensely.\n\nI think of you and the boys constantly. The distance feels vast, yet my heart remains in Berlin. I trust your health is good and that the house is at peace. I shall write again soon.\n\nYour loving husband,\nHegel"}}],"created":1795219049,"model":"qwen","system_fingerprint":"b11429-d81235049","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":199,"prompt_tokens":953,"total_tokens":1152,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-f3Brr0HlW1WRPTebqQzNcsL7AZLHvLbL","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":953,"prompt_ms":964.592,"prompt_per_token_ms":1.0121636935991605,"prompt_per_second":987.9824837858908,"predicted_n":199,"predicted_ms":4686.28,"predicted_per_token_ms":23.668080808080806,"predicted_per_second":42.250996526029176}}